1) In Nethack ascending with a lower score beats
ascending with a higher score.  Thus high score
lists only matter to folks who have never ascended.

2) Scores on your own computer are easily hacked
and therefore irrelevant.

3) There are specific strategies in NetHack that
increase score.  There are games on record that
hit MAXINT doing so.  This does not in any way
mean they are better games.  Based on point one
above it means they are worse games.


